  <item>
    <title>工具7-坚持不懈地专注于解决方案（《柳舟记》男女主的最大的魅力点）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d440a44a0f950f84aede64</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d440a44a0f950f84aede64</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 10:23:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>优秀的人拥有“坚持不懈地专注于解决方案 （relentless solution focus）的能力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们不会像很多影视剧人物或是现实中的一些人，遇到问题陷入自觉身不由己的痛苦内耗中不能自拔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>遇到挑战时，他们也会抱怨或发脾气，但是不会让自己在里面耽溺太久，而是马上去想应对之策，迅速执行，并在行动过程中根据结果不断调整策略。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>脚注</span></h3><span></span><p><span>[1] </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMwOTA5Ng==&amp;mid=2650777066&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6e34c54620679544402c15d9edfec5bb&amp;chksm=8817ef2dbf60663b2efc23f525f0232e9617f6ad72ffa2bae115861150ba2fb9dab923b2b8ee&amp;cur_album_id=3531120013065895941&amp;scene=190#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMwOTA5Ng==&amp;mid=2650777066&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6e34c54620679544402c15d9edfec5bb&amp;chksm=8817ef2dbf60663b2efc23f525f0232e9617f6ad72ffa2bae115861150ba2fb9dab923b2b8ee&amp;cur_album_id=3531120013065895941&amp;scene=190#rd"><span>做出决定后，道路才显现丨《Start Right Where You are》#1</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>[2] </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&amp;timestamp=1725174651&amp;ver=5479&amp;signature=v5oQ0vupMicOxb3p0L7ROehkuopcmSn0MmKVrvweRv9uAtl8snYtcv5XdUIOM02B-WT9mhKtdVe9rG5lCvPXhYne-z5IAWvF-Tg10iV5O3RGULxCN8oY9CStlZrcf7Bc&amp;new=1" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?src=11&amp;timestamp=1725174651&amp;ver=5479&amp;signature=v5oQ0vupMicOxb3p0L7ROehkuopcmSn0MmKVrvweRv9uAtl8snYtcv5XdUIOM02B-WT9mhKtdVe9rG5lCvPXhYne-z5IAWvF-Tg10iV5O3RGULxCN8oY9CStlZrcf7Bc&amp;new=1"><span>情绪小崩溃后的软重启丨The Instant Mood Fix #7</span></a></p><span></span><h3><span>您可能也会有兴趣的其他工具</span></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMwOTA5Ng==&amp;mid=2650777158&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=36063e3d8302715ea9fb07084c3ed03c&amp;chksm=8817ec81bf60659707e7e73e02b68e100d88574c038cc446e870926cd1b576877d0b5924a42d&amp;cur_album_id=3573458671276982274&amp;scene=189#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMwOTA5Ng==&amp;mid=2650777158&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=36063e3d8302715ea9fb07084c3ed03c&amp;chksm=8817ec81